    description: "Found by the 2026-11-07 docstring staleness audit (dev 4f2feb451b): a reviewer flagged it and a default-REJECT verifier re-reproduced it on a fixture of its own (reports under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/staleness_audit_11072026/review, verify and blind). Corpus impact not measured. symbol_resolution.py:740-750 returns the first match when neither hint stage narrows to one; the same first-substring pattern is at :329-337 and :428-435. ListNameResolver accepts a hint only when it narrows to one (:1002-1003). NameResolver({'A.run':a,'B.run':b}).lookup('run', path_hint='util') with both under lib/util/ returns a (path_hint, 0.9); without the hint it is suffix_ambiguous. path_hint callers include haskell, ocaml, julia, dart, fsharp, elm, zig, csharp. r16, v06."  # 03c1
